  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Added\n- New analyzer rule FFS0055 prohibits UnconditionalSuppressMessageAttribute, except suppressions for trimming and AOT (#517)\n### Fixed\n- FFS0014/FFS0015 no longer report JsonSerializer overloads taking JsonTypeInfo or JsonSerializerContext (#501)\n- FFS0021/FFS0034 analyzers now map arguments to parameters by name and position (reordered, multi-line and static forms) and compare by constant value, fixing false negatives\n- FFS0039/FFS0040 now detect types declared inside file-scoped namespaces, ignoring file-local types, so these types are no longer missed (#506)\n### Changed\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.322\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.analyzers to 2.3.0\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.v3 to 4.0.3",
